e porta il già fragile equilibrio familiare ad un punto di rottura. Mentre i bambini aspettano un segno che li guidi, che sia una voce dall'alto o una canzone in tv, intorno e dentro di loro tutto cambia."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Clara and Felice struggle to raise their three children in 1970s Rome. The eldest, Andrea, is transgender and yearns for another life where he gets to live as the boy he knows himself to be. Clara instinctively strives to protect her son by escaping into their imaginations to defuse family tensions."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/673FW0QFGkd0T81NgExzLqTIpL3.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rjw4AXWCJ3AYmmM2CkNOD6LcGT.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":770724,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"it-IT","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/673FW0QFGkd0T81NgExzLqTIpL3.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/673FW0QFGkd0T81NgExzLqTIpL3.jpg","language":"it","width":1776,"height":2664},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/673FW0QFGkd0T81NgExzLqTIpL3.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/673FW0QFGkd0T81NgExzLqTIpL3.jpg","language":"it","width":1776,"height":2664},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/z0EBydaGK8yaW6NZXli5HgdElOf.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/z0EBydaGK8yaW6NZXli5HgdElOf.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eLGbqWCV7aXAYqwn0IVbnIRLy6H.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eLGbqWCV7aXAYqwn0IVbnIRLy6H.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":2800}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8zVoxTnEXEbCAv4BCJRvb54sJKl.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org